// Runtime entry points SnowboardKidsEngine exports to the game module.
//
// ELF modules resolve these against the -rdynamic engine executable. PE/COFF
// modules need them listed: CMake turns this file into the engine's .def
// export table, and the module builder turns it into the import library the
// Windows SnowboardKidsGame.dll links against. Add a symbol here whenever the
// generated corpus starts calling a new runtime function.
//
// SBK_ENGINE_EXPORT entries are C-linkage recomp_func_t runtime functions.
// SBK_ENGINE_EXPORT_C entries are C-linkage helpers with their own signature.
// Data (RSP DMEM) is passed through SbkEngineApiV1, never imported.
